  3	/**
  4	 * Unit tests for namespaced project link generation in insights.js and
  5	 * knowledge.js (WP-012).
  6	 *
  7	 * Acceptance criteria tested:
  8	 *   AC-1: `insights.js` project links use `#/projects/{repo}/{slug}` when
  9	 *         `repository_name` is available.
 10	 *   AC-2: `knowledge.js` origin-plan links use `#/projects/{repo}/{slug}`
 11	 *         when `repository_name` is available.
 12	 *   AC-3: Entries with null `repository_name` do not generate broken links —
 13	 *         graceful fallback is applied (plain text, no anchor).
 14	 *   AC-4: No link in either view still uses the bare-slug form without repo.
 15	 *
 16	 * Uses jsdom + vm.runInThisContext to execute the browser-side scripts in
 17	 * the globalThis context, mirroring the approach in client-rendering.test.ts
 18	 * and orchestrator-view.test.ts.
 19	 */
